  "notes": [
    "Default mode: APT first; if apt_name is null or the package is absent, build from source using the recipe in 'source'.",
    "If both apt_name and source are null the package is skipped with a warning.",
    "Source builds install into /usr/local and therefore require sudo.",
    "Hyprland is APT-only by design (source: null); use --via-nix if it is unavailable in your repositories.",
    "Nix attributes depend on the nixpkgs revision; --via-nix is fully self-contained and skips APT and source entirely.",
    "Some fonts (e.g. fonts-material-symbols) may be missing from older repositories; the installer warns and continues."
  ]
